#. <CLT 9>山田を殺した凶器<CLT>は…
msgctxt "0001 | SAKURA OOGAMI"
msgid "What was <CLT 9>used to kill Hifumi<CLT>...?"
msgstr ""

#. ジャスティスハンマー３号なのか？
msgctxt "0002 | SAKURA OOGAMI"
msgid "Was it Justice Hammer 3?"
msgstr ""

#. ジャスティスハンマー４号なのか？
msgctxt "0003 | SAKURA OOGAMI"
msgid "Maybe Justice Hammer 4?"
msgstr ""

#. どちらにしても…
msgctxt "0004 | CELES"
msgid "Well, whatever it was..."
msgstr ""

#. 犯人はどのようにして…
msgctxt "0005 | CELES"
msgid "...there's one thing we have to figure out."
msgstr ""

#. それらの凶器を
#. 持ち運んだのでしょうね？
msgctxt "0006 | CELES"
msgid ""
"How was the culprit able to move around\n"
"so freely with the weapon?"
msgstr ""

#. しかも、誰にも
#. <CLT 9>目撃される<CLT>事なく…
msgctxt "0007 | CELES"
msgid "How did nobody <CLT 9>witness<CLT> them carrying it?"
msgstr ""

#. 今明らかになる
#. <CLT 9>ジャスティスハンマー５号<CLT>！！
msgctxt "0008 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid ""
"Sounds like a <CLT 9>Justice Hammer 5<CLT>\n"
"is about to make its appearance!"
msgstr ""

#. 詳細はウェブで！！
msgctxt "0009 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid ""
"Check out murdergear.com/\n"
"hammertime for more info!"
msgstr ""

#. とりあえず、
#. ハッキリしてんのは…
msgctxt "0010 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid "Well, one thing seems pretty clear..."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 9>どっちかのハンマーが
#. 凶器<CLT>って事だけか！
msgctxt "0011 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid ""
"The murder weapon had to be\n"
"<CLT 9>one of the Justice Hammers<CLT>!"
msgstr ""

#. うぅ…それだけか…
msgctxt "0012 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid "And, uh...that's about it."
msgstr ""
